  "description": "cmix v21 forced text-mode wrapper using mmap allocation, PAQ8 level 5, a 100 MB PPMD cap, minimum PAQ8 main/text maps, halved PAQ8 match-model memory through CMIX_PAQ8_MATCH_DIV=2, sparse-match divisor 8, RCM32 run-context maps, and a thirtysecond-size PAQ rolling buffer. The binary and english.dic are gzip-compressed and counted toward program_size.",
